{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "aa5b7bb3-0202-8393-bf0f-c19cf68b92ee",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T11:45:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Donna DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:41:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:41:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Hello, Denise. This is Donna DeLuca. I'm calling about the crosswalk by my house. The paint is all faded and the cars just don't stop for anybody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:42:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Whereabouts is the crosswalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:42:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at sixty-eight Admiral Kalbfus Road. That's six... eight. Sixty-eight. Up the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:42:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 68 Admiral Kalbfus Road. And you said the lines are worn off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:42:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Worn right off. You can hardly see them. I called about it before, you know, and nobody came. Nobody did one thing. [pause] Hold on one second, I'm in the shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:42:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:42:42-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, the door keeps going. Every time somebody comes in the bell rings. I'm in the shop getting a few things because I can't wait for the weather to be nice to cross that road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:42:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear it, no problem. Is this a road with a lot of traffic?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:43:04-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a bus route. The bus stops right near there, and I take it. So I'm out there standing, waiting to cross, and these cars come flying through. They look right at you and keep going. I'm eighty-some years old. I can't be running across."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:43:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you shouldn't have to. That's a real safety issue, and I'll get it written up as a request to have the crosswalk repainted. Do you remember about when you called before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:43:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, it was, um, the fall. October, I think. Maybe the end of September. I don't have it written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:43:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's okay. I'll note that it's a repeat complaint so it doesn't get treated like new."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:43:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good. Because it's been months. So how long does it usually take? For them to fix something like that. Repaint it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:44:04-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, with the cold, painting is tricky. The crews usually can't do striping until it warms up, so it's more likely a spring job. Once the weather turns, you're probably looking at a few weeks to get on the schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:44:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Spring. [pause] So the whole rest of the winter I'm just supposed to hope."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:44:28-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. What I can do is flag it as a crossing near a bus stop, and ask whether anyone can put up a temporary sign or look at it sooner. I can't promise that, but I'll put it in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:44:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'd appreciate that. A sign would be something at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:44:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back when it's scheduled? I have a number here ending in zero one five zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:45:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's me. Four, oh, one. Five, five, five. Zero, one, five, zero. That's the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:45:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, that matches. I'll put your name on the request and someone will call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:45:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I hope somebody does this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:45:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll make sure the note is clear. Take care crossing out there, Mrs. DeLuca."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:45:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will, I'll be careful. Thank you, Denise. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
